# NLE / viewer modules

- Prefer small files under `components/timeline/`, `components/viewer/`, `store/timeline/`.
- Before adding logic to `TimelineStrip`, `Viewer`, or the timeline store facade: extract the touched concern (TrackRow, Player, commands, queries, …).
- Timeline mutations only via `commands.*` / `run` (undo/redo). Do not write `doc` directly from UI.
- Keep `PlanBatchBar` in its own module — do not couple strip ↔ PlanInspector through exports.
- Behavior and hotkeys stay unchanged during extract refactors.
